{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784830/extras/packTac_UI_0001_Layer-2-copy.png?t=1749489800\" />Pack Tactics is a bite-sized auto battler card game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Build your pack of animals to compete for territory against other players packs. Your deck is your ecosystem and all changes to your animals are permanent! Cultivate symbiotic strategies and claim your spot at the top of the food chain!<br><br><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Quick, Tactical Fights</strong> \u2013 Jump into fast-paced battles with no downtime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udce6 <strong>New Pack Each Round</strong> \u2013 Choose between a rare, two silvers, or a horde of bronze animals every turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Your Deck is an Ecosystem</strong> \u2013 Predator and prey, synergy and survival. Make wild card combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Play at Your Own Pace</strong> \u2013 Async multiplayer lets you take your turn when you're ready.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2620\ufe0f <strong>Permanent Consequences</strong> \u2013 Cards evolve or perish for the entire run. If an egg hatches, you keep the animal. If it's eaten\u2014it's gone.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive. Adapt. Dominate the wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784830/extras/packTac_UI_0000_Group-1.png?t=1749489800\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3784830?t=1749489800","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3784830?t=1749489800","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784830/e31b805